# Build context of the RoboARC release image (images/roboarc/build.sh builds images/roboarc/Dockerfile from source/): only what the recipe COPYs.
**
!assets/
!assets/robots/
!assets/robots/**
!assets/textures/
!assets/textures/genesis/
!assets/textures/genesis/**
!images/topogym/prune.py
!images/roboarc/
!images/roboarc/**
!topogym/
!topogym/**
# no solutions in any image (images/topogym/prune.py removes them again after COPY)
topogym/agents
topogym/planning
topogym/data
topogym/**/deferred
topogym/**/legacy
topogym/**/redundants
topogym/**/rollout_simulation
**/*.md
# Relay robot identity includes the original robot documentation bytes.
!assets/robots/**/*.md
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/.secrets/**
